notes = "Runs pure-Hangul Aheui programs. Output bytes are rendered as CP437, with an 8x8 font; typed characters are mapped back to CP437 bytes, so the DOS high half can be entered as well as displayed. PNG content stores the grid as pixel residues mod 40; .aheui and .txt are read as an Aheui grid directly; .b and .bf are compiled to Aheui on load. Keyboard input is used for programs that read characters. Save states are not implemented."
